      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming asked his father: “Dad, what is your worst experience of failing when trying to act cool?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "爸爸说：“刚和你妈妈在一起的时候，我看她炒出来的菜全部都是黑色的，",
      "traditional": "爸爸說：“剛和你媽媽在一起的時候，我看她炒出來的菜全部都是黑色的，",
      "pinyin": "bà ba shuō gāng hé nǐ mā ma zài yì qǐ de shí hou wǒ kàn tā chǎo chū lái de cài quán bù dōu shì hēi sè de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "就对她说‘看看，你炒的是什么东西？让开，看我怎么炒的。’",
      "traditional": "就對她說‘看看，你炒的是什麼東西？讓開，看我怎麼炒的。’",
      "pinyin": "jiù duì tā shuō kàn kan nǐ chǎo de shì shén me dōng xi ràng kāi kàn wǒ zěn me chǎo de",
      "english": "Dad said: “When I just started dating your mom, I noticed that she fried all the food until it turned black.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "当时觉得自己帅呆了。可从那以后，我再也没有能放下过这锅铲……”",
      "traditional": "當時覺得自己帥呆了。可從那以後，我再也沒有能放下過這鍋鏟……”",
      "pinyin": "dāng shí jué de zì jǐ shuài dāi le kě cóng nà yǐ hòu wǒ zài yě méi yǒu néng fàng xià guò zhè guō chǎn",
      "english": "“So I told her: ‘Look, what are you frying? Step aside and watch how I do it.’”"
    }
  ],
