    "sentence_translations": [
      "Acting Cool",
      "",
      "Little Ming asked his father: “Dad, what is your worst experience of failing when trying to act cool?”",
      "",
      "Dad said: “When I just started dating your mom, I noticed that she fried all the food until it turned black.”",
      "“So I told her: ‘Look, what are you frying? Step aside and watch how I do it.’”",
      "“At the time I thought I was super cool. But since that moment, I haven't been able to put down this spatula…”"
